# Conventional commits

Use [.cursor/skills/conventional-commits/SKILL.md](../skills/conventional-commits/SKILL.md) when drafting commit messages.

Prefixes: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`

Optional scope: `feat(wat):`, `feat(agenthooks):`

Subject: imperative mood, concise. Body: explain *why*, not only *what*.
